item.description:
[NEW] &lt;p&gt;To support Spain's upcoming mandatory &lt;strong&gt;B2B electronic invoicing requirements under the Crea y Crece&lt;/strong&gt; legislation, Microsoft Dynamics 365 Finance will introduce capabilities for domestic B2B electronic invoicing through a phased rollout.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The planned rollout includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt; (GA: May CY2027) — Dynamics 365 Finance, Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management, Dynamics 365 Project Operations

&lt;p&gt;Real-time streaming analytics is built into the new supervisor application. An advanced streaming engine keeps metrics up to date with near-instant updates, allowing supervisors to view the latest data without refreshing the dashboard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key capabilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continu (GA: October CY2026) — Dynamics 365 Contact Center
